  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_b605dd6eae9d45c8bacd55e2b6d4263c",
      "statement": "The Redis-backed BFF session has its own lifecycle independent of the Keycloak JWT: idle and absolute timeouts come from env.sessionIdleTimeoutMs / env.sessionAbsoluteTimeoutMs (SESSION_IDLE_TIMEOUT_MS default 30 min, SESSION_ABSOLUTE_TIMEOUT_MS default 24 h), so killing a session and JWT expiry are unrelated events.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://frontend/mcm-app/src/bff-server/session-manager.ts#L28-L85",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:d50b238f40cf5c15449b481a62f48a881619a730a0649a15927c1756dda7f667:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://frontend/mcm-app/src/config/env.ts#L50-L53",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:6a4fe55b103fd18aeb5c12234f2f4e1c9e285bff5b965bc9bfc1204ec504390b:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f1cfd75ee7aa48388a5dd0ed9acf19f4",
      "statement": "A Session holds only sessionId (randomUUID), userId, createdAt, lastActivityAt and expiresAt — no token material, roles or profile — and createSession sets createdAt = lastActivityAt = now with expiresAt = now + env.sessionAbsoluteTimeoutMs.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://frontend/mcm-app/src/bff-server/session-manager.ts#L36-L42",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3eb04d0eb89535e78dad180974564f22c8ab42ab8d2d42394dee6cf0d6859033:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://frontend/mcm-app/src/types/auth.ts#L79-L87",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4d79dfab542e9f30c130aacbd790039d5780f3ed5df552261d132af76236e086:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e9f17907322b44c2b41736a044f57fc9",
      "statement": "cache-service.ts stores each session under the key session:<sessionId> as JSON with a Redis EX TTL, and tracks the user's session IDs in the set user-sessions:<userId> (SADD/SREM), which is what the per-user count (SCARD) and eviction enumeration read.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://frontend/mcm-app/src/bff-server/cache-service.ts#L37-L39",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:7afdf446d60313bd53dd84baa42f9fbace93b7d36c8d1cc9cb435da3b18fc909:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://frontend/mcm-app/src/bff-server/cache-service.ts#L94-L130",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:7f6c0a07b6088e58e197ce738af6ba2510f83e3295e83970b296d7b6b89dfc90:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_bbad5e355b2f4d5cb1a10b2d94bb71b8",
      "statement": "The Redis key TTL is a backstop sized from the session's remaining absolute lifetime (floored at 1 s), never the policy itself; a shorter fixed TTL would silently truncate the configured idle/absolute windows, which is what a previous hard-coded 600 s did to a 30-min idle / 24-h absolute policy (feature 009 finding #3).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://frontend/mcm-app/src/bff-server/cache-service.ts#L20-L33",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f18d17cad8dd7553e3b812d9128627b5f7a3df0c5dacdeebd18c9a830b6a0769:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://frontend/mcm-app/tests/integration/session-manager.integration.test.ts#L44-L56",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:260d8d7fa59ebf5b65011ba302c85b109bb50e355214785bd59bb3906714439c:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_ca4026055d744b8aa04b59567028319d",
      "statement": "getValidSession is the authority for expiry: it deletes the session and returns null when now > expiresAt or when now - lastActivityAt exceeds env.sessionIdleTimeoutMs, and touchSession slides the idle window by rewriting lastActivityAt. There is no background reaper — expiry is detected lazily on the next request, and session-timeout.ts maps the failure onto SESSION_IDLE_TIMEOUT / SESSION_ABSOLUTE_TIMEOUT.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://frontend/mcm-app/src/bff-server/session-manager.ts#L61-L97",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:701743db42e9f0f015515353a731f7d5aba38ce486481bf22b1b1c04bec99d5a:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://frontend/mcm-app/src/bff-server/session-timeout.ts#L17-L55",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:c1ca29921244fd70e33b6400e8c2a88adc3229963be7c880ce9a04ccaebdb15b:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_457be5f9c76740b18764e91a6146de91",
      "statement": "createSession enforces the per-user concurrent-session cap in two steps: a pre-add count check that evicts when the count is already at MAX_SESSIONS, then a post-add trim loop that re-reads the count and keeps evicting while it exceeds the cap. The second step exists because the pre-add check alone is TOCTOU-racy under simultaneous logins (feature 009 FR-018), and its no-progress break (next >= count) prevents an infinite loop against stale set members whose session objects are already gone.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://frontend/mcm-app/src/bff-server/session-manager.ts#L28-L59",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ad6ca6bfdbf266b96b9cfb47916910f6e432fc7d1a950e5991ab8f7f2dda56b4:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://frontend/mcm-app/tests/integration/concurrent-session-cap.integration.test.ts#L1-L38",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a64754746ffdd605357683a07a724e40565de2a7c24898ee32b60d05b58d8f7f:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_4e909af5e3924780a14c92eeb576f505",
      "statement": "Eviction removes the valid session with the smallest lastActivityAt (least recently active, not necessarily oldest by createdAt), and MAX_SESSIONS is bound once at module load from env.maxConcurrentSessions (MAX_CONCURRENT_SESSIONS, default 10), so changing the env var after import has no effect.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://frontend/mcm-app/src/bff-server/session-manager.ts#L116-L131",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b90123ff985973d4d748e651b4eeed33b2f40251fd3eaca1d45ed6abb52b7a9e:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://frontend/mcm-app/src/bff-server/session-manager.ts#L19-L19",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:36c3ba60765e5c6e16f214f19fc642fff3688dd4e78d2c707d4253044b64ac9a:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://frontend/mcm-app/src/config/env.ts#L53-L53",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:62851eb1792183253f06bca367170eae964c8f9eda59a2bf799d851aa101e444:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_ddd9b61db04044ec9b7900c3f47f5d0c",
      "statement": "Every cap-driven eviction emits a logger.audit('session_evicted', { userId, activeSessions, maxSessions }) event, and the evicted session ID is deliberately never logged under any key: under the name sessionId the logger would redact it while still tripping the mcm-no-token-logging SAST rule, and any other key would leak it (feature 052 FR-004).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://frontend/mcm-app/src/bff-server/session-manager.ts#L133-L148",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:874988026328e902b523bc6197f3baf9b527d2b1089588af6f91eb382cf5795b:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://frontend/mcm-app/tests/integration/concurrent-session-cap.integration.test.ts#L61-L82",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:8f7e842cdd30386d1676ff11ad5ca97464d8a81fb7e2b97cddc5fde284a114d5:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_59ceee9abe6c4f8ea9c8deed145686e7",
      "statement": "session-manager.ts performs no ownership verification — it is a keyed lookup module. Routes must check that the loaded session's userId matches the JWT subject before calling getValidSession/touchSession/terminateSession, as auth/user+api.ts and auth/logout+api.ts do, so an unauthenticated request carrying someone else's session id cannot slide, expire or terminate that victim's session (feature 009 finding #9).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://frontend/mcm-app/src/app/bff-api/auth/logout%2Bapi.ts#L28-L55",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:8868369fd1a086a9719d132b3d660a2fd0aba918a34b8cc909fa2c34cc049504:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://frontend/mcm-app/src/app/bff-api/auth/user%2Bapi.ts#L25-L43",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:d10af7e41b1a215a4ea21efb1d2db2966c559cf88b6ab213a8732fb02c97ff66:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e3d19589e249431590e327207ebce28e",
      "statement": "The client never holds a token. Auth lives entirely in the BFF's HttpOnly SameSite=Strict cookies; on web nothing is stored client-side, and on native only the opaque session id is kept in SecureStore as a startup hint for hasStoredSession(), which the AuthProvider treats as a hint only and follows with a /bff-api/auth/user call that decides the real auth state.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://frontend/mcm-app/src/bff-server/auth.ts#L137-L156",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5e20024f9667f7358846a195e1c51e60b565893b4e7c80214da8bd9aa01f2262:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://frontend/mcm-app/src/hooks/use-auth.tsx#L48-L63",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:978d1fa962aa3b81c1cf30dd3394fb97bae3337fc60e073d18507c0fe2182ea7:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://frontend/mcm-app/src/utils/session-storage.ts#L1-L65",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b71caf5eb097105db227a9892b34424d0450598073d76131802dc48eb4c9d35a:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f3f0ebcecbd84b5bae67d8a137388203",
      "statement": "The session id reaches the client on login both as the mcm_session_id HttpOnly cookie and as the X-Session-Id response header (read by use-login.ts and the native auth callback, then persisted via storeSession()); subsequent requests are authenticated by the access-token cookie and extractSessionId() reads only the mcm_session_id cookie.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://frontend/mcm-app/src/app/bff-api/auth/login%2Bapi.ts#L103-L131",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:138220a615d1fb1b10a0ba030d523a018c67948232887ad307bedd864209eb44:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://frontend/mcm-app/src/bff-server/auth.ts#L123-L135",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f9ce2f246c16c284cb5f2d688b972c7092bd4d729a34d7969213bce761282730:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://frontend/mcm-app/src/hooks/use-login.ts#L26-L44",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b0b29f0d58e3802dd35e771dc42978e628c3e11df75f112ee891a91b0dbc7e36:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_99677c04b8e3432daf3afa093bafd5af",
      "statement": "terminateSession ends one session (logout) while terminateAllSessions enumerates the user's session set and deletes every session, which is what account deletion uses so a deleted account's sessions cannot survive.",
      "evidence": [
