    },
    {
      "id": "claim_255798cfb4344cff87052cfb52f88d4f",
      "statement": "Session lifecycle is tested in two tiers on purpose: unit-tests/session-manager.test.ts mocks cache-service for cap, expiry and Redis-error behaviour, while session-manager.integration.test.ts and concurrent-session-cap.integration.test.ts run against real Redis (db 1) because a mocked client cannot prove that a concurrent-login race has exactly one winner.",
